{"server":"cn","storyId":"act16d5_level_act16d5_01_beg","groupId":"act16d5","stageId":"act16d5_01","title":"初醒","storyCode":"WR-1","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act16d5/level_act16d5_01_beg.txt","sourceHash":"2ebfbc3a1c93788727e8974f8f9101080b90264ff5279e8517db56ea49edf02d","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"听罢了说书人的故事，炎熔一行已然身处一座奇异小镇。种种古怪却让他们意识到，自己也许已经身陷困境。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"书接上回，说那跛脚书生败兴而归，自此之后，郁郁不得志。\n哪件事？\n自然是画。\n什么画？\n是那书生痛失故友，心如死灰，一蹶不振十数载后，再一次地灵犀一动——他打定心思，殚心竭虑，发誓要完成那幅毕生力作。\n要画什么？\n要画未见之物。\n要如何画？\n得作未想之想。\n诶，话说到这儿，就有点儿意思了。各位都知道，人所想象之极限，一定是所见所知的经验。要靠想象勾勒出未曾知晓的事物，骗别人简单，骗自己，难如登天。\n毕竟这天底下，哪有能想出自己没见过的东西的能人呢？\n那书生对着白纸苦思十来天，瘦了足足三十多斤。本就跛脚，形貌越发恐怖。\n时入深冬，书生家早已断粮。邻里害怕他那副模样，皆不敢近。\n直到某天，跛脚书生几度朦胧醒来，四肢无力，却头脑清明。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_white"},{"type":"narration","text":"他深知自己大限将至。环顾四周，家徒四壁，恍惚间，只感觉四下无物，真真正正变成了孑然一身。\n书生逐渐看不见眼前被大雪打湿又冻上的地面，再听不见门窗漏出的风雪动静。睁眼眨眼，落入混沌，感到墙壁正在远游离去，书案消散，笔墨纸砚皆如过眼云烟。\n某个时刻，他忽然得知了窗外鹅毛大雪的具体数目，得知了月光的角度与云层的真理。他伸手摸索夜幕，又不小心摔倒在地，地面却不再是双脚的阻碍，他坠向地底，而又飞向深空。\n他睁眼却不能看，凝神却不能听，周遭黑暗一片——他却反而忽地狂喜起来，好像只有在这绝无外物干扰的境地，他才能寻到真正的创作，而非对其他已有事物的临摹与亵渎。\n他继续等，等到寂灭一片，连自己干枯的肉身也感受不到，他才开始思考——只有在这万事万物都不复存在，唯有他的意识独自清明时，他短暂地成为了他精神的主宰。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_light"},{"type":"narration","text":"他的想象再也不受拘束，创造着存在也不存在的事物——在他思维的疆土上，各种怪诞平地而起，盖过了现实。\n那天深夜，隔壁起夜的老夫子，看见跛脚书生的茅屋里流光溢彩，光怪陆离，发出各种平生未闻的声响，难以名状。老夫子起胆，就隔着墙偷瞄了一眼。\n只那一眼，便再不敢深究。他匆匆忙忙回到屋里，久久不得入眠。\n隔天，邻里纷纷来到茅屋前，夺门而入，发现了书生的遗体，再无别物。大家都以为他是冻死的，村长上前一看，书生面前摊着一张白纸，落满了霜，啥也没画。\n事后，人们便感慨书生走不出过往，痴死在画卷前。也有说是书生早就染了怪病，控制不住自己的法术，才整出这些怪事。\n唯一窥见真相的老夫子，却从不对别人说起这件事。只是在他临终前，他对自己的儿子说，那被人唾弃，连名字都被忘记的跛脚书生，是真正的千古大家。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_landscape"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"为啥子？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"说书人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"因为那个跛脚书生在那晚切实完成了诺言，切实画出了“世间从未有过之物”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"咋感觉和书上写的内容不大一样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"说书人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"老夫子来不及说出为什么，或者压根就说不出为什么就咽了气。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"说书人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"于是坊间流传的说辞，就只有跛脚书生从春风得意到失魂落魄的这么一段。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"说书人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"至于真相如何，恐怕无人知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"可是画没见过的东西，那有啥难的嘛，我回去乱涂一幅，你们不也没见过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"说书人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，话不能这么说。你从没见过大湖，但见过雨后积水，我便告诉你，湖是很多的积水。说到底，你还是见过的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"说书人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"这跛脚书生，厉害就厉害在这儿了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"那照你这么说，他到底画了啥？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"说书人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"谁知道呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"嗨，能不能别老讲这么复杂的，咱不爱听啊，啥时候讲讲其他的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_142","isRemote":false,"text":"我要听上次那“形单影只向天去，雌雄双剑分天下”的大结局！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"说书人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"会讲的，都会讲的。天下讲不完的事，我用寥寥百年的阳寿去讲，要是还奢求面面俱到，就有点贪得无厌了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"说书人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"既然你们想听，那下一回，咱们就讲点别的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_142","isRemote":false,"text":"好诶！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"说书人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"老规矩，我这张嘴，不值钱。但是诸位的茶钱，得看着给。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"说书人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"今儿似乎有几位新面孔，不知三位客人对我这些奇闻怪谈，可还满意？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"......这是真事儿？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"说书人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"若是说有个书生染了矿石病，遂愿之前便郁郁而终，我倒确信是件真事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"说书人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"添油加醋，方有滋味啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"在理！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"说书人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"多谢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"说书人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"只不过，我也不知道这些奇闻野史，到底有几分是真的......只是有这方面的兴趣，仅此而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"说书人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"话说回来，我虽然不是什么正儿八经的说书人，也在镇上以此打发了许久光阴，不过愿意来听我胡说八道的，其实就那么几位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"说书人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"这看着三位面生，不知？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"咳——（使眼色）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"啊——是了是了，我这两位朋友，远道而来，要找个人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"不过这二位在咱们大炎这儿人生地不熟的，所以我就略帮小忙，代为引路，不知先生怎么称呼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"说书人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"我离家多年，早就弃了旧名不用。早年舞文弄墨，自号“煮伞居士”，虽有些恬不知耻，但也沿用至今。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"好意境！好意境啊！这不巧了，小弟也是被迫无奈，背井离乡，如今也只好借“乌有”二字暂代姓名，不如你就喊我乌老弟呗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"（我就说他这名字是编的吧——！？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"（嘘......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"（克洛丝？你发现什么了？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"（嗯？啊，没有啦，我只是觉得看他每次都要生编硬套很好玩嘛。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"（......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"说书人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"原来同是天涯沦落人，那不知道三位要找的人，是谁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"嗨，俗话说得好，相逢即是缘，真是巧得不能再巧了。我们要找的人，也是个画家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"说书人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"......画家？这小镇不大，可从未听说过有什么画家。是个什么样的人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......恩人？您给说说？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"是一位女性。呃，头上应该长着奇特的角。还会一些奇特的法术。然后......然后......是个画家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"说书人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"就这样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"......就这样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"说书人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"你这么一说，就更没印象了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，这就奇了怪了......莫非二位恩人要找的人，已经离开了这里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"说书人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"这小镇极少有来客，要是如各位所说，那位奇人当给我们留下印象才是。我可以托人帮你问问。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"好，好，那就不叨扰先生了，我们这就——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"这就......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"说书人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"乌有先生？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，你怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，嘿嘿，我们......我们是从哪儿进来的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"你在说什么，我们不是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"说书人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"——沿着这条小道，便可离开园林。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"说书人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"想必几位是跟着人群来这里，迷了路吧？哈哈，我这园子不大不小，实在认不得路，问个佣人便是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿......你瞧我这糊涂的，怎么就记不住了呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"说书人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"若是关于那位画家，找到了什么线索需要帮忙，尽管问我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"说书人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"我还有点事情，诸位，不送。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"诶，多谢多谢，不用送，不用送。二位恩人，我们先走吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"等等——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_town"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"接下来，咱们去哪儿瞧瞧？这茶馆，驿站，园子都去过了，还有啥地儿可能有线索的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"......我们到这里多久了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，怎么突然问这个？大概......三两天时日？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"你确定？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"啊哈哈，嗨，多半是昨天晚上没睡好，我有点犯迷糊嘞。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"小炎熔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......我感觉到了......但是很模糊的......好像......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"这种时候还是要跟着直觉走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"直觉告诉我，现在情况很麻烦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"是某种精神层面的源石技艺......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......法术的话......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"二位恩人，还嘀咕啥呢？再不走快点，天就要黑啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"说什么呢，天色还——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_ac16_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——天......色？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我们竟然从来没有看过天空......？明明只要一抬头就能发现的......真奇怪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"恩、恩人，这是啥情况？你看那边儿，好像......好像都出月亮了呀！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可现在不是大白天吗，桥那头怎么都点灯笼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"看身后......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"耶？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......另一个方向的天边，那是......是太阳？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊，是不是从那头到这头走个来回，就相当于\"走过了\"一天一夜？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这还真......新奇。总是听年说大炎地大物博无奇不有......还有这种景观？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔，等等，我口袋里好像有什么东西......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这是，年给我的护身符......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"慢着......慢着！不对，不对！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"什么叫“这种景观”啊，我刚才在想什么......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"乌有！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"诶——？我在，我在！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"这里到底是不是泥翁镇！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"这......这还用说......呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"这，这仔细看看似乎是有点不对，可这附近也没有别的镇子了呀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"......还是不对，不对。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"克洛丝，我们从罗德岛出发，先抵达了勾吴城，补给之后，翌日上午出城。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"然后我们在前往灰齐山的荒原上看见了一辆撞毁的车——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"——然后二位恩人从那些畜生手里救下了我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"只是把它们带到了适合筑巢的新窝而已啦。它们也挺不容易的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"然后呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"然后我们......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯嗯，然后我们直接登上了灰齐山，找到了一间破茅屋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"我推开了那儿的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"......门？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"钟声？哪里的钟声？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"敲钟了？敲钟了！喂，快去把家里人都喊起来！动作快！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么回事！都这么长时间了！为什么会是今天！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"那个......！请问发生什么了！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"你们，你们是外人？敲钟就说明西边的山里来怪物啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"那些怪物见不得光，只要跑到有太阳的地方，就安全了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"怪，怪物？什么怪物？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，没空和你瞎唠叨啦！别挡着我，我得把老婆带到这儿来呀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"妈妈！妈妈！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"都在这儿了吗？还少谁！快去找找！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"恩人，恩人，咱们也赶紧去避难吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"说是只要跑到有太阳的地方就没事儿了？那咱们赶紧——恩人？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"......克洛丝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"准备好啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"——恩人！？别闹啦，我们自个儿都是一团浆糊，还是先躲躲再说吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"诶！诶诶！这怎么就冲过去了！唉！我的好恩人呐，你们——等我，等我一下啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","aliases":["炎熔"]},{"speakerId":"char_455_nothing","aliases":["乌有"]}]}
